{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lush, luxurious soundtrack comes from the beautiful mind of <strong>Hitoshi Sakimoto</strong> - the legendary composer for <strong>Final Fantasy Tactics, Valkyria Chronicles</strong> and <strong>Final Fantasy XII</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of intricate orchestral arrangements rendered in crisp digital stereo, this transportive masterpiece is as elegant as it is catchy - you\u2019ll be humming it in every spare moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>38 track OST</strong> is the connective tissue which holds the Songs of Silence experience together, weaving between battle and exploration with subtle slickness. Download it today and listen at your leisure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685650/extras/36296bee073777a7c90d2bb35080e240.avif?t=1769439175\" width=617 height=794 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685650/extras/3e6b495ccccec6b8b1d21c016a0f6447.webp?t=1769439175\" width=617 height=25 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2685650?t=1769439175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2685650?t=1769439175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769439175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769439175","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our lush, luxurious soundtrack comes from the beautiful mind